{"id":"a0a8374d48d26bd5","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-initial-algebra.md","title":"等式模型类中的初始代数","display":"df-initial-algebra — 等式模型类中的初始代数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-initial-algebra","aliases":["56-df-initial-algebra"],"display":"df-initial-algebra — 等式模型类中的初始代数","depends_on":["[[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]","[[56-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_section":"7.2.1(ii)","source_pages":"267","source_ocr_blocks":[288],"source_statement_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-initial-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-initial-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-initial-algebra — 等式模型类中的初始代数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f75e1125f61f318\" href=\"?note=4f75e1125f61f318\" title=\"56-df-sigma-homomorphism\">56-df-sigma-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b729ff69dbfa830d\" href=\"?note=b729ff69dbfa830d\" title=\"56-df-satisfaction\">56-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.2.1(ii)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"267"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>288</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为固定变量集、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)^2\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\">\\(\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\\)</span>。模型谓词和同态分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b729ff69dbfa830d\" href=\"?note=b729ff69dbfa830d\" title=\"56-df-satisfaction\">56-df-satisfaction</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f75e1125f61f318\" href=\"?note=4f75e1125f61f318\" title=\"56-df-sigma-homomorphism\">56-df-sigma-homomorphism</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 在集合论元语言中取遍非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 取遍下式指定的全运算解释族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B^0=\\{()\\}\">\\(B^0=\\{()\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(A,I)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{EqModels}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,E)\\land\n\\forall B\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\forall J\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}B^{B^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{EqModels}_{\\Sigma}(B,J,E)\n\\Longrightarrow\\exists!h\\in B^A\\;\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(A,I)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{EqModels}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,E)\\land\n\\forall B\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\forall J\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}B^{B^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{EqModels}_{\\Sigma}(B,J,E)\n\\Longrightarrow\\exists!h\\in B^A\\;\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 7.2.1(ii)。量词描述所有模型中的泛性质，不需要也不构造“所有模型的集合”。初始性要求到每个模型恰有一个同态，包括到自身。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，7.2.1(ii)，印刷页 267。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-sigma-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"4f75e1125f61f318","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"b729ff69dbfa830d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"b729ff69dbfa830d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$V$ 为固定变量集、$E\\subseteq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)^2$，$\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$。模型谓词和同态分别见 [[56-df-satisfaction]]、[[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]。$B$ 在集合论元语言中取遍非空集合，$J$ 取遍下式指定的全运算解释族；$B^0=\\{()\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-sigma-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"4f75e1125f61f318","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$V$ 为固定变量集、$E\\subseteq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)^2$，$\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$。模型谓词和同态分别见 [[56-df-satisfaction]]、[[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]。$B$ 在集合论元语言中取遍非空集合，$J$ 取遍下式指定的全运算解释族；$B^0=\\{()\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"B^0=\\{()\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(A,I)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{EqModels}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,E)\\land\n\\forall B\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\forall J\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}B^{B^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{EqModels}_{\\Sigma}(B,J,E)\n\\Longrightarrow\\exists!h\\in B^A\\;\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1624,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-251","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-initial-algebra.md]]"},{"id":"6efb0e699c13a985","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$V$ 固定，$(G,I_G)=\\mathbf T_0(\\Sigma,V)$ 如 [[56-df-ground-term-algebra]]，并假设 $G\\ne\\varnothing$。初始性取 [[56-df-initial-algebra]]；目标 $\\Sigma$-代数的解释与赋值取 [[56-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"94ce4cc247b1553c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$、$E\\subseteq T^2$。令 $G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\\ne\\varnothing$，$Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}$、$Q_G=Q\\cap G^2$，$\\mathbf{GTM}(\\Sigma,V,E)=(G/Q_G,I_{G,Q})$。模型与初始性见 [[56-thm-term-model-satisfies-equations]]、[[56-df-initial-algebra]]；等式语义健全性取 [[56-thm-birkhoff-completeness]] 的正向蕴涵。"},{"id":"3b81403d289d8fbb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设同一 $\\Sigma,V,E$ 下 $\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(A,I)$ 与 $\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(B,J)$，见 [[56-df-initial-algebra]]。同态、同构见 [[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]。"}],"outgoing":["4f75e1125f61f318","b729ff69dbfa830d"]}